            "text": "Same-Level Expression Test (Item #17)\n\nlfo1 and const1 are at the same graph depth (no wire between them).\nconst1 has an expression: chop('lfo1', 'out') * 10.0\n\nThe expression edge injection should force lfo1 to cook BEFORE const1,\neven though both start at topo level 0.\n\nExpected: const1 shows lfo1's sine wave * 10 (smooth animation).\nBroken: const1 reads stale/zero data (lagging one frame or stuck).\n\nWith multithreading_enabled = true, the expression edge prevents both\nnodes from landing in the same parallel batch.",
